Homepage: @APP_HOMEPAGE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libgl1, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libx11-6 | libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: libpulse0, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libdecor-0-0, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxext6, libxinerama1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxrender1, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, libudev1
Description: @APP_SUMMARY@
 King Grumbold the Petty has grievances. Swing the trebuchet, let go at just
 the right moment, and bring his neighbours' castles down: 36 castles in three
 realms, seven breakable materials, eight kinds of ammo, and a castle editor
 with offline share codes.
 .
 No ads, no in-app purchases, no tracking and no network.
